obs Read the voice, whole card, Bakery prompt, handoffs, top three day-shelf rows, prior recommendation, fleet roster, and live claim sentences. Copal owns its bounds control, Pheromone its Glow recovery, and Diffuser its motion study. The claim reader returned commits_behind=0 and overlap_peer=0. This lap reviews a parked draft; it opens no production instrument or booked repair.
obs Round-open finished on 4ff324584ae2d76a71036c604560a501ef810752 with a clean tree. All 85 stashes remain preserved. The fleet process reader found no local roster runner and refused seven foreign checkouts. The current bakery transcript was inspected; it is already this lap's overwritten stream, so the prior committed log remains the durable handoff.
obs Reviewed six versions from stash d057c741dbf6ff576ce26e7aa63e423613519312: three witness edits in its working tree and three new suffix assertion files in third-parent tree 6b8ebf3c3594f8982c12ad41fede74a8bd7305df. This follows the five versions reviewed by the prior lap. Eighty-five of the original 96 unmatched source versions still await semantic review.
obs The three witness edits replace substring assertions with word-boundary matches in session_roster_agree, silent_leg, and standing_equipment. Current source retains the elder substring assertions at the changed sites. The path-absence reader fetched xy and found the proposed scan, control, and witness absent both locally and upstream. This establishes pending source, not a safe recovery.
obs Extracted exact draft blobs into session-output/bakery-suffix-review-pen. Its controls ran in private scratch beneath this checkout. With a symlink to the current Rishi executable, all 32 control checks passed, including false substring acceptance, corrected-match refusal, and honest corrected-match acceptance. These results establish the draft's existing cases only.
loom suffix_control with_runtime_checks=32 with_runtime_failed=0 without_runtime_checks=32 without_runtime_failed=0
obs Repeated the draft control before supplying its Rishi executable. All 32 checks still reported success; the three hazard fields printed yes because the missing-runtime branch compares skipped with skipped. This is false testimony about execution. Recovery must make the missing-runtime case explicit and prevent it from satisfying runtime-proof assertions.
obs A second pen plants one tracked emitter and one tracked witness. The emitter prints plant=0 deep_plant=1 in one echo statement; the witness asserts that its output contains plant=1 and incorrectly exits zero. The draft scan reports emitted_keys=1, ambiguous_pairs=0, exposed=0, cohort_exposed=0, verdict=within. Its greedy emitter expression keeps only the last key on the source line.
obs Changing only the emitter to two echo statements prints the same two key/value facts on separate lines. The scan now reports emitted_keys=2, ambiguous_pairs=1, exposed=1, cohort_exposed=1, verdict=cohort_exposed. The substring witness still incorrectly exits zero. This comparison proves a coverage gap for multiple literal keys on one source line; it makes no whole-tree exposure claim.
loom suffix_parser one_line_keys=1 one_line_exposed=0 two_line_keys=2 two_line_exposed=1 substring_witness_exit=0
obs The draft remains preserved for revision. A recovery must cover multiple emitted keys per source line and fail or explicitly gate missing runtime evidence. The three witness edits need their current controls rerun before landing. The draft's broad control success does not discharge these new cases.
obs Local receipts are session-output/bakery-suffix-control-runtime.txt, session-output/bakery-suffix-control-no-runtime.txt, and session-output/bakery-suffix-parser-comparison.txt. The stash and third-parent identifiers above retain the reviewed source independent of these scratch files.
obs This record changes the Bakery handoff, its card pointer and parent nib, and the day-shelf log. Production source stays unchanged. Full cold, cadence, and hot remain owed; the prior 9837-second estimate exceeds the recorded 5400-second lap window. No full or scoped roster verdict is claimed and no roster runner crosses this lap boundary.
